  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "When face of the largest area is touching the table, height of centre of gravity above the table <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo> </mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>cm</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />With its length vertical, height of centre of gravity would become <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>8</mn> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>cm</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Minimum work required W = (P.E.)<sub>2</sub> – (P.E.)<sub>1</sub><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = mg(h<sub>2</sub> – h<sub>1</sub>)<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mi></mi><mi>W</mi><mo>⁡</mo> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>8</mn> <mo>×</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>8</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>J</mtext> </mrow> </math>",
